```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Chatbot Simulation</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
  .modal {
    position: fixed;
    top: 50%;
